### Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

###

### Start a new three-service saga
POST http://localhost:5000/api/saga/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "req-001",
  "initialData": "test-data-123"
}

###

### Check saga status (replace {sagaId} with actual ID from start response)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/saga/status/your-saga-id-here

###

### Start another saga with different data
POST http://localhost:5000/api/saga/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "req-002",
  "initialData": "another-test"
}
